{"id":"smite-of-merain","name":"Smite of Merain","type":"Pulse Rifle","tier":"Legendary","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e47393574637ea49389e500ab365b311.jpg","screenshot":"/common/destiny2_content/screenshots/2221264583.jpg","columns":[{"label":"Barrel","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Arrowhead Brake","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f7fb54687aa52a9c2595d90ce9c9417.png","desc":"Lightly vented barrel.\n  •  Greatly controls recoil\n  •  Increases handling speed"},{"name":"Chambered Compensator","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0b451cbccc7f11f6aec9c153e59474cb.png","desc":"Stable barrel attachment.\n  •  Increases stability\n  •  Moderately controls recoil\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Corkscrew Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7730e1732ed7ef91afce50277639c493.png","desc":"Balanced barrel. \n  •  Slightly increases range and stability\n  •  Slightly increases handling speed"},{"name":"Extended Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9e5e8fa07a84c29252b78b0e7b3106d.png","desc":"Weighty barrel extension.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Decreases handling speed\n  •  Moderately controls recoil"},{"name":"Fluted Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/260eba9dd149dbb94b1306c9ed4dd8db.png","desc":"Ultra-light barrel. \n  •  Greatly increases handling speed\n  •  Slightly increases stability"},{"name":"Full Bore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40a4bdcf0f5a4e492927f9569eaf529d.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for distance.\n  •  Greatly increases range\n  •  Decreases stability\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Hammer-Forged Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/2b9eb6d4489cffc18c10223279198bcc.png","desc":"Durable ranged barrel.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Polygonal Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d7aaccee29cf450d4057a9de871cdc8.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for recoil reduction.\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Smallbore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d1bb6a623f14959a47156ee71acfc3a.png","desc":"Dual strength barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Full Choke","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/629246e67fc8690d56b5478b0262131a.png","desc":"Tightened barrel. Reduces projectile spread when aiming down sights at the cost of precision damage."},{"name":"Rifled Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/79d5f1f469d3290cfb849f4b3e6fc16b.png","desc":"Ranged shotgun barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Greatly decreases handling speed"}]},{"label":"Magazine","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Accurized Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d85024478504205359c7fb52dbc4f6b6.png","desc":"This weapon can fire longer distances.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Appended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9f468cce26fe35d9db413e2f8451127.png","desc":"This weapon's magazine is built for higher capacity.\n  •  Increases magazine size"},{"name":"Tactical Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f0e309a267b25279a871d182f8910bcc.png","desc":"This weapon has multiple tactical improvements.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases magazine size"},{"name":"Extended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/66cfea124e24e73cca1ce6370b44ca7e.png","desc":"This weapon has a greatly increased magazine size, but reloads much slower.\n  •  Greatly increases magazine size\n  •  Greatly decreases reload speed\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"},{"name":"Steady Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6c6e1cc341487a8afd0b0c714a229255.png","desc":"This magazine is optimized for recoil control.\n  •  Greatly increases stability \n  •  Slightly decreases range\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"},{"name":"Alloy Magazine","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/069170916c98748b7b3e33b80bd7d689.png","desc":"Faster reload when the magazine is nearly empty."},{"name":"Flared Magwell","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f95e67e4ff37466505d66d3fa1030782.png","desc":"Optimized for fast reloading.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed"},{"name":"Ricochet Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a494d0442b32aff8c30d8b2b53561bd.png","desc":"Rounds ricochet off hard surfaces. \n  •  Increases stability \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Light Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/736b486ddb80beefacb4f09b5ad016eb.png","desc":"Improved reload and range.\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Armor-Piercing Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b311ef00478243e21e2a5eec3a59f9d8.png","desc":"Rounds cause extra damage to combatants' shields and overpenetrate targets. \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Drop Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d19f0c349652f0285bb5f999307b8a1.png","desc":"Increases reload speed but reduces magazine size."},{"name":"Assault Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/953cfdeb2703978b1ab449b991b98989.png","desc":"This shotgun's magazine is optimized for quick combat.\n  •  Greatly increases stability\n  •  Increases rate of fire"},{"name":"High-Caliber Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d1c49edb2d2b24c74067742c09fd5a5.png","desc":"Shots from this weapon knock the target back farther.\n  •  Slightly increases range"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Ensemble","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/421d6325598857bc63c1df0f25607cde.png","desc":"Improved handling and reload speed when allies are nearby."},{"name":"Moving Target","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40b591eae7f122fdf1cfca21fc6f6c0f.png","desc":"Increased movement speed and target acquisition when moving while aiming down sights."},{"name":"Pugilist","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/93bb6bb34fb0616805ba2a7181ab386c.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon generate melee energy. \nDealing melee damage briefly improves this weapon's handling."},{"name":"Demolitionist","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/da009697110e06b65d6f827b3b6d5f70.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate grenade energy. Activating your grenade ability reloads this weapon from reserves."},{"name":"Well-Rounded","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/29d63faf15876cf3a9a382aa857b608b.png","desc":"Throwing a grenade or hitting a target with a charged melee grants a stacking bonus to weapon stability, handling, and range.\n\nUsing a Super grants maximum stacks."},{"name":"Focused Fury","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/15fb47018719c99ae37d10f794bc957e.png","desc":"Dealing a portion of the magazine as precision damage grants this weapon bonus damage. The shot count is reset whenever the weapon is reloaded or stowed."},{"name":"Stats for All","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8aadd7fd25c2b1e9f3fc7f4411a97ea4.png","desc":"Hitting three separate targets increases weapon handling, stability, reload, and range for a moderate duration."},{"name":"Ancillary Ordinance","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9565cff650175f7f2c083af28db2dc60.png","desc":"Rapid elemental final blows and final blows on targets affected by elemental debuffs periodically prepare a homing micro-missile, which is launched from your target after this weapon's next final blow. Multiple missiles can be prepared."},{"name":"Bewildering Burst","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/74c6e8d0ff9596e2ea9b45073701b48b.png","desc":"Reloading this weapon after defeating a target causes the next hit to launch a Kinetic projectile that detonates into a disorienting blast."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Eye of the Storm","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f4755f9068959b26b8829641e5725ad.png","desc":"This weapon becomes more accurate and boosts handling as your health gets lower."},{"name":"Gutshot Straight","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/5c4c785bde7b9808d48ded283256750e.png","desc":"Aiming down sights increases body shot damage, decreases target acquisition."},{